# defined-as-exists-bothrep (#270 disc 461 Claude-3)
library "Pol".

// A both-representation `code is` + `defined as exists` twin. lowerLocalCodes builds
// a union fold-in twin for ANY `defined as` body; folding `LocalSource.asTruths()
// union exists(...)` mixes a truth-set List with a scalar Boolean (ill-typed) and
// would SILENTLY drop the concept's own local records from its truth. The `code is` +
// `defined as` fold is validator-rejected (E1) but emitCQLFromAST is validator-free,
// so the inferred-lane emit refuses it loud.

concept "Other Records":
- type is Observation.
- shape is RecordSet.
- code is `other`.

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `adult`.
- defined as exists ( "Other Records" ).

activity "Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage":
- when "Adult Patient" then recommend activity "Refer".
